      "content": "SP 81 NW 1/26 BIERTON WITH BROUGHTON AYLESBURY ROAD (north side) No 70 (Formerly listed as No.70 Cedar Villa) GV II House. Early C19, red brick, slate roof, nipped to left. 2 storeys, 2 sash windows in reveals with flat gauged arches, 4 panes wide to first floor, 5 panes to ground floor LH, 6 flush panel door (2 upper panels glazed) to RH with similar arch. Tiled lean-to at rear with one side window to each floor. Listing NGR: SP8362915343"
